<title>UK: BP/Mobil UK cat cracker seen restarting in 2-3 day.</title>
<headline>BP/Mobil UK cat cracker seen restarting in 2-3 day.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 60,000 barrels per day (bpd) BP/Mobil British Coryton refinery's catalytic cracker is expected to restart in the next two to three days, earlier than had been anticipated last week, a spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We would estimate that it will be back in operation in the next two to three days, the spokesman said, adding that it was &quot;just possible&quot; that the catcracker could restart operations as early as Monday.</p>
<p>The company said on Friday it expected the outage, which was caused by technical problems, to last until the end of the week.</p>
</text>
